    {
      "id": 55207,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-15T16:53:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think the logic train of this situation goes like this - BB takes enough damage to reduce him to zero or fewer hp.&nbsp; Instead of taking that damage (i.e. he doesn't take the damage), he flips, at which point his hp are raised to 30.&nbsp; So, because he never took the damage, there's nothing to carry over to the back side.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:29:52.540Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
